🎯 MARTIAL ARTS DASHBOARD in Power BI – built without using DAX!

I created a visually rich and functional dashboard using only views and a relational data model, completely avoiding DAX.
The idea was to leverage the full power of the data layer, while using Power BI purely as a visual presentation tool.

🔹 Faster development
🔹 Easier maintenance
🔹 Clear separation between data and visuals

This is another great example of how important proper data modeling and preparation are before jumping into visualization.

👊 Topic: Martial Arts
📊 Tech: Power BI + SQL (views)
